the problem you have is related to comment `// use specific version of data binding until google resolves the bugs with mixed case package names` in `app/build.gradle`

when you open xDrip (after clean clone) in Android Studio it will ask you `Plugin Update Recommended: Android Gradle Plugin is ready to update.`. Ignore that otherwise you will get into troubles.

@jamorham do you know what is the problem ? by quick try there is no reason to wait until `google resolves the bugs with mixed case package names`. Is it needed to rename something manually in xDrip code to get it fixed and to upgrade to latest Gradle plugin ?
